<p>When a single hit deals more than <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">32%, 25%, 21%, 18%, 16%</acronym> of your maximum life another you appears and takes <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">13%, 31%, 42%, 49%, 54%</acronym> of the damage as well as <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27%</acronym> of all damage you take for the next 2 turns.</p><p>The clone is out of phase with this reality and deals 50% less damage but its arrows will pass through friendly targets.</p><p>This talent has a cooldown.</p>